\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-2-1920x1080-f137936690f5-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-2-1920x1080-f137936690f5-1536x864.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-2-1920x1080-f137936690f5-640x360.jpeg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-2-1920x1080-f137936690f5-960x540.jpeg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-2-1920x1080-f137936690f5.jpeg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-2-1920x1080-f137936690f5-160x90.jpeg 160w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/dt><\/dl><br style=\"clear: both\" \/>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Bien \u00e9videmment pour que la tenue soit compl\u00e8te, Epic Games propose des accessoires.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>L&rsquo;accessoire de dos Gadget de gladiateur\u00a0: \u00e9quipez-vous pour le combat.\u00a0(Inclus avec la tenue Patrick Mahomes.)<\/li>\n<li>La pioche Haches rougissantes\u00a0: r\u00e9serv\u00e9es aux experts. (Luit en rouge quand on l&rsquo;agite\u00a0!)<\/li>\n<li>Le rev\u00eatement \u00c9lite de l&rsquo;en-but\u00a0: de l&rsquo;\u00e9quipement pour vos \u00e9quipements.<\/li>\n<li>L&#8217;emote Place au jeu\u00a0: de retour sur le terrain.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Enfin, concernant la tenue Mahomes sauc\u00e9, elle comprend l\u2019accessoire de dos Super sauce.<\/p>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-50741\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-3-1920x1080-4b78d84cccbe-1024x576.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-3-1920x1080-4b78d84cccbe-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-3-1920x1080-4b78d84cccbe-500x281.jpeg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-3-1920x1080-4b78d84cccbe-150x84.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-3-1920x1080-4b78d84cccbe-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-3-1920x1080-4b78d84cccbe-1536x864.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-3-1920x1080-4b78d84cccbe-640x360.jpeg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-3-1920x1080-4b78d84cccbe-960x540.jpeg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-3-1920x1080-4b78d84cccbe.jpeg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21br-apex-blogassets-inline-3-1920x1080-4b78d84cccbe-160x90.jpeg 160w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Bien que les deux tenues seront disponibles dans la boutique d\u2019objets d\u00e8s le 25 ao\u00fbt, pour ceux qui ne veulent pas attendre, la tenue Patrick Mahomes pourra \u00eatre gagn\u00e9e lors de la Coupe Patrick Mahomes qui se tiendra le 23 ao\u00fbt.<\/p>\n<h2>La Coupe Patrick Mahomes<\/h2>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-50742\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-apexwildcup-social-1920x1080-1136c0e28825-1024x576.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-apexwildcup-social-1920x1080-1136c0e28825-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-apexwildcup-social-1920x1080-1136c0e28825-500x281.jpeg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-apexwildcup-social-1920x1080-1136c0e28825-150x84.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-apexwildcup-social-1920x1080-1136c0e28825-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-apexwildcup-social-1920x1080-1136c0e28825-1536x864.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-apexwildcup-social-1920x1080-1136c0e28825-640x360.jpeg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-apexwildcup-social-1920x1080-1136c0e28825-960x540.jpeg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-apexwildcup-social-1920x1080-1136c0e28825.jpeg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-apexwildcup-social-1920x1080-1136c0e28825-160x90.jpeg 160w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Ce tournoi devrait faire plaisir \u00e0 plus d\u2019un joueur, car elle se d\u00e9roulera sur le mode Z\u00e9ro construction et en \u00e9quipe. De plus, il sera \u00e9galement possible d\u2019obtenir l&rsquo;accessoire de dos Gadget de gladiateur en acc\u00e8s anticip\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>Pour cela, il faudra obtenir le plus de points possibles en un maximum de dix parties dans la fen\u00eatre de temps d\u2019environ trois heures.<\/p>\n<p>Afin de remporter la tenue Patrick Mahomes ainsi que l&rsquo;accessoire de dos Gadget de gladiateur, il faudra figurer entre la 1ere position et la 325 eme pour la r\u00e9gion d\u2019Am\u00e9rique du Nord-est, et entre la 1ere position et la 125 eme pour la r\u00e9gion d\u2019Am\u00e9rique du Nord-ouest. Par ailleurs, peu importe la r\u00e9gion et le classement, une fois 8 points gagn\u00e9s, l\u2019emoticone Sauce secr\u00e8te sera offerte.<\/p>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-50743\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-social-rewards-emote-1920x1080-1920x1080-e37dbfa290fd-1024x576.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-social-rewards-emote-1920x1080-1920x1080-e37dbfa290fd-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-social-rewards-emote-1920x1080-1920x1080-e37dbfa290fd-500x281.jpeg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-social-rewards-emote-1920x1080-1920x1080-e37dbfa290fd-150x84.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-social-rewards-emote-1920x1080-1920x1080-e37dbfa290fd-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-social-rewards-emote-1920x1080-1920x1080-e37dbfa290fd-1536x864.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-social-rewards-emote-1920x1080-1920x1080-e37dbfa290fd-640x360.jpeg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-social-rewards-emote-1920x1080-1920x1080-e37dbfa290fd-960x540.jpeg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-social-rewards-emote-1920x1080-1920x1080-e37dbfa290fd.jpeg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/08\/fr-21comp-social-rewards-emote-1920x1080-1920x1080-e37dbfa290fd-160x90.jpeg 160w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/p>\n<h2>Syst\u00e8me de points<\/h2>\n<p>Concernant le syst\u00e8me de points, chaque \u00e9limination rapportera 1 point en plus de ceux obtenus gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la position dans le classement.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Victoire royale\u00a0